
>> animal := Into entsha. 
 
 animal xa-kufika: ['name:'] yenza: { :n
eyakho igama := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal xa-kufika: ['igama'] yenza: { <- igama.
}.

>> cat := animal entsha.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat xa-kufika: ['igama'] yenza: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (ngokwakho igama).
}.

Imveliso bhala: cat igama.
